<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-C-C Amatil completes Kuok placement.</title>
<headline>RTRS-C-C Amatil completes Kuok placement.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coca-Cola Amatil Ltd said on Thursday it had completed the A$663.09 million placement of 46.0 million ordinary shares to Robert Kuok's Kerry Group.</p>
<p>The placement, representing 9.275 percent of C-C Amatil's issued capital, was announced on August 8 and described as a way of developing and improving links in key Asian markets.</p>
<p>C-C Amatil said the placement followed approval by the foreign investment regulatory board. The ex-dividend shares were issued at A$14.51 each, well below the stocks's A$16.18 valuation on Thursday. C-C Amatil is 40 percent owned by The Coca-Cola Co.    -- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
